    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμάραγδος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰ], ἡ
