			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σμάραγδος, ἡ</span>, name of the emerald mines in Egypt, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχιμεταλλάρχου τῆς Ζμαράγδου</span>”
				<i>Proc.Soc.Bibl. Arch.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					31
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				1909
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				323
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταλλάρχη</span>
			(gen. sg.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζμαράκτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					660.2
				</span></i>
			 (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>); also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σμάραγδος ὄρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Geog.</u>
					4.5.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
